# Datadog dashboards

Native JSON under `datadog/dashboards/` follows
[standards/observability/dashboards-as-code.md](https://github.com/opsdevcode/repave/blob/main/standards/observability/dashboards-as-code.md)
v1.1.0.

- Use consistent tags (`service`, `team`, `org`, `env`, `managed-by:repave`).
- Prefer `$env` template variable over hard-coded environment in queries.
- Extend RED widgets before adding unrelated charts so on-call layouts stay familiar.

